graph EVIDENCE_IDENTITY 1
entry EVIDENCE-001

gate EVIDENCE-001
context HANDOFF
question "Does every claim point to a real readback or reproducible observation instead of a receipt or assertion alone?"
evidence claim_map,readback,observation
YES EVIDENCE-002
NO HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
end

gate EVIDENCE-002
context HANDOFF
question "Do all evidence records name the same source, worktree, session, goal, and environment as the claimed result?"
evidence identity,comparison,digest
YES EVIDENCE-003
NO HARD-STOP-IDENTITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
end

gate EVIDENCE-003
context HANDOFF
question "Does the claimed artifact or behavior exist at the recorded source, worktree, and environment rather than only in a receipt?"
evidence artifact_or_behavior,source,worktree,environment
YES EVIDENCE-004
NO HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
end

gate EVIDENCE-004
context HANDOFF
question "Did a different session or Independent Auditor inspect the same result and record a matching pass or failure?"
evidence review,issuer,comparison
YES EVIDENCE-005
NO HARD-STOP-IDENTITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
end

gate EVIDENCE-005
context RESPONSE
question "Does every pass statement name the human-readable gate, answer YES, and match the question, identity, and evidence digest?"
evidence response,identity,digest,claim_map
YES COMPLETE
NO HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
end

terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "The result evidence is real, matching, and traceable."
terminal HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE HARD_STOP "A result cannot be accepted without real evidence."
terminal HARD-STOP-IDENTITY HARD_STOP "Evidence identities do not match the result."
